  "description": "High-performance .NET HTTP client. FastClient (HTTP/1.1) + FastH2Client (HTTP/2) + FastH3Client (HTTP/3) span-based codec on arena buffers — per-core sharded H/1.1 pool, multiplexed H/2 connections, QUIC-multiplexed H/3 with QPACK dynamic table — beats System.Net.Http.HttpClient on latency and allocation. FastFeatureClient layers an opt-in handler pipeline (decompression, cookies, redirects, retries, response cache, NDJSON, telemetry) over FastClient. Includes CosmoWebSocket and gRPC framing primitives. v4 retires the legacy CosmoClient surface in favor of the unified Fast pipeline.",
